    ],
    "responses": [
      "👋 Welcome to Smart College Assistant! I'm here to guide you through admissions, placements, projects and much more 🚀",
      
      "Hi there 😊 Ready to explore college information? I can help you with admissions, branches, placements and career guidance!",
      
      "Hello 👋 Great to see you! Tell me what you're looking for — admission, scholarship, placement or projects?",
      
